chip ym2610
clock 8000000
samples 30000
mem adpcm-a ym2610-a.bin
fidelity min
# ADPCM-A from external memory in 256-byte units, at the minimum fidelity:
# each channel's start and end addresses, level and pan, keyed in turn and
# together, the total level, a dump, and the end-of-sample flags in the
# extended status, masked and reset through 0x1C.
0 w 2 01 3 3f
0 w 2 10 3 00 2 18 3 00 2 20 3 07 2 28 3 00 2 08 3 df
0 w 2 11 3 08 2 19 3 00 2 21 3 0d 2 29 3 00 2 09 3 9f
0 w 2 12 3 10 2 1a 3 00 2 22 3 13 2 2a 3 00 2 0a 3 5f
0 w 2 13 3 18 2 1b 3 00 2 23 3 1f 2 2b 3 00 2 0b 3 dc
0 w 2 14 3 20 2 1c 3 00 2 24 3 22 2 2c 3 00 2 0c 3 d8
0 w 2 15 3 28 2 1d 3 00 2 25 3 2e 2 2d 3 00 2 0d 3 df
0 w 2 00 3 01
2500 r 2
3000 w 2 00 3 02
5500 r 2
6000 w 2 00 3 04
8500 r 2
9000 w 2 00 3 08
11500 r 2
12000 w 2 00 3 10
14500 r 2
15000 w 2 00 3 20
17500 r 2
18000 w 2 00 3 3f  # all six
18500 r 2
19500 r 2
20000 w 0 1c 1 05  # mask and reset channels 1 and 3's flags
20500 r 2
21000 w 0 1c 1 00
21500 r 2
22000 w 2 01 3 30 2 00 3 3f
22500 r 2
23000 w 2 00 3 9a  # dump four
23500 r 2
24500 r 2
25500 r 2
26000 w 2 20 3 40 2 00 3 01  # a span past the image's end reads 0
26500 r 2
27500 r 2
28500 r 2
29500 r 2
